        <mxCell id="c57" value="Notation: rounded box = process (number in the top strip);  open-ended box = data store;  shadowed box = external entity, drawn outside the system boundary.&lt;br&gt;*  marks a duplicated symbol drawn twice to reduce crossing connectors. Both Customer symbols are the same single entity; both D3 symbols are the same single data store.&lt;br&gt;Delivery simulation (4.5.1) is an internal component of process 4.5, not an external entity. Every data flow is one-directional and named." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="734" width="1121" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
